  "source": "openneuro",
  "readme": "This dataset contains behavioural, resting-state EEG, working-memory EEG, and TMS-EEG data from healthy adult participants.\nThe dataset includes behavioural task files and EEG data organised according to the Brain Imaging Data Structure (BIDS). Tasks include resting state, working memory, TMS-EEG, and cognitive/behavioural tasks.\nParticipants are identified using anonymised subject labels. No directly identifying information is included.\nFor details of the experimental procedures, task descriptions, preprocessing status, and data quality checks, please refer to the associated dataset manuscript.",
